# #191 Rifleman into Jaina: a powershield returns Rifleman's blaster shot, not a frost bolt
# a (Rifleman) fires its neutral special at 600 from x -240; b (Jaina) at x 240 powershields it with
# one full trigger press. A reflection sends back a's own projectile: same family (a's fighter
# code), kind and model, half damage, turned around and owned by b (the `reflect` line on b's
# trace), and it strikes a, never b. Frames are read from this script's headless farm trace.
# Syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick pair rifleman / jaina proudmoore
600 a tap X 2
616 b shield 1
646 b shield 0
# View held a second: a moment the parity check replays.
662 a press VIEW
732 a release VIEW
# Expected (replay of this script): b's press reflects on the next frame; the projectile hits a for half its damage.
#! expect b 617 reflect family 1 kind 0 model Abilities\Weapons\CannonTowerMissile\CannonTowerMissile.mdx direction -1 multiplier 0.500 life 50
#! expect a 632 damage 1.395
#! absent b 600-662 damage
